    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-1",
      "text": "紫霞独自站在云层边缘自言自语，说天空是一片荒漠，天宫里精美的东西在成为天宫一部分时就已被剥夺了灵魂。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0023/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0023"
      },
      "revealed_at": 19,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000019.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000019",
          "chapter_order": 19,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "这天空就是一片荒漠"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-2",
      "text": "紫霞只在众神散去、无人时会独自说话，她说众神称她为「永远微笑的紫霞」，但她认为没有人会永远微笑。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0023/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0023"
      },
      "revealed_at": 19,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000019.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000019",
          "chapter_order": 19,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "他们叫我‘永远微笑的紫霞’"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-3",
      "text": "紫霞的独白中还提到，若有人听她说话，不要像二郎神那样不耐烦地冷笑，也不要像天蓬那样语重心长地反驳。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0023/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0023"
      },
      "revealed_at": 19,
      "source_refs": [
